>> title: Chickpea and Spinach Curry
>> servings: 4
>> tags: main, vegan, curry
>> time: 35 minutes

Fry @onion{1}, finely chopped, in @vegetable oil{2%tbsp} in a #pan{} for ~{8%minutes}.

Add @garlic{3%cloves}, @ginger{20%g}, @curry powder{2%tsp} and @ground cumin{1%tsp} and cook for a minute.

Tip in @chickpeas{480%g}, @tinned tomatoes{400%g} and @coconut milk{400%ml} and simmer for ~{15%minutes}.

Stir through @spinach{200%g} until wilted, then season with @salt{1%tsp} and @lemon{1} juice.

Serve with @rice{300%g}.
